{
  "_comment": [
    "Tissue selection for the GTEx v10 single-tissue cis-eQTL release.",
    "INCLUDE-list: only 'load': true reaches the parquet.",
    "GTEx ships all 49 tissues in one 2.39 GB tarball and does not expose",
    "them individually (per-tissue URLs return 404), so the download is",
    "all-or-nothing and this list controls transform and output only.",
    "Output stays one file per chromosome with the tissue carried in the",
    "bio_context column; tissue is a dimension of this release, not a",
    "separate source.",
    "Default is the 13 Brain tissues, matching what the pipeline loaded",
    "before this became configurable. Enabling all 49 takes the output",
    "from ~18.5 M rows to roughly 70 M."
